      959              vardeviationcli-qnty (TOTAL)
      960              vardevfactdoc-qnty   (TOTAL)
      961              vardevfactcli-qnty   (TOTAL).
      962   display stream repstr
      963   sym1  space(0) buf_trn-doc.shift-name
      964   sym2  space(0) buf_trn-doc.shift-date
      965   sym3  space(0) buf_trn-doc.doc-code
      966   sym4  space(0) buf_doc-line.doc-qnty
      967   sym5  space(0) buf_doc-line.cli-qnty
