      969   sym7  space(0) vardeviationcli-qnty
      970   sym8  space(0) vardeviationperc
      971   sym9  space(0) vardevfactdoc-qnty
      972   sym10 space(0) vardevfactcli-qnty
      973   sym11 space(0) vardevfactperc
      974   sym12 space(0)
      975   with frame doc-line-frm .
      976   down stream repstr 1 with frame doc-line-frm.                    end.
      977       END.
      978       WHEN 3 THEN DO:
